kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"row 3 duration\">\n                                3 years\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[13px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"row 3 action\">\n                                Open\n                                <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-3-5-1\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"row 3 action icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--teal-dark)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.5fr_.75fr_.9fr_.65fr_auto] items-center gap-5 px-6 py-5 no-underline hover:bg-[#F9FCFC]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"row 4 link\" href=\"#\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"row 4 title cell\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"row 4 title group\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"row 4 title text\">\n                                        B-Tech Human Resource Management\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <span class=\"rounded-[5px] bg-[#EAF7F8] px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"row 4 badge\">\n                                        BTECH\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"row 4 code\">\n                                    HND-HPD-BTECH-HRM-btechhumanresourcemanagement-1\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"row 4 degree\">\n                                B.Tech\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"row 4 unit\">\n                                B.Tech Academic Organ\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-4\" data-name=\"row 4 duration\">\n                                1 year\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[13px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-5\" data-name=\"row 4 action\">\n                                Open\n                                <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-4-5-1\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"row 4 action icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--teal-dark)\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--line)] bg-[#FAFBFC] px-6 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"table footer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[12px] text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"footer question text\">\n                            Need a more specific match?\n                        </span>\n                        <a class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[var(--navy)] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"footer link\" href=\"#eligibility\">\n                            Check your subjects\n                            <i class=\"ml-1 inline h-4 w-4 align-[-3px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-2-1\" data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" data-name=\"footer arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--navy)\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Faculties: compact browse list -->\n        <section class=\"section-shell mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-8 py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"faculties section\" id=\"faculties\">\n            <div class=\"faculty-header flex items-end justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"faculties header\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"faculties intro\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"faculties label\">\n                        Browse by academic unit\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-3 text-[38px] font-bold tracking-[-.045em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"faculties headline\">\n                        Our faculties & schools\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"faculties description\">\n                        Start with the area of study that feels closest to your goals.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[var(--navy)] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"see all faculties link\" href=\"#\">\n                    See all faculties\n                    <i class=\"ml-1 inline h-4 w-4 align-[-3px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" data-name=\"see all faculties icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--navy)\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faculty-grid mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 border-y border-[var(--line)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"faculties grid\">\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"faculty link 1\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            FS\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            Faculty of Science\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"faculty link 2\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            FHS\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            Faculty of Health Sciences\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"faculty link 3\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            FEMS\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            Faculty of Engineering\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-3-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-4\" data-name=\"faculty link 4\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            FALSS\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            Arts & Social Sciences\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-4-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-5\" data-name=\"faculty link 5\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-5-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            FOE\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            Faculty of Education\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-5-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-6\" data-name=\"faculty link 6\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-6-1\" data-name=\"faculty name group\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--teal-dark)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"faculty code\">\n                            CAT\n                        </span>\n                        <strong class=\"ml-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"faculty name\">\n                            B.Tech Academic Organ\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-6-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" data-name=\"faculty arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#8793A4\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- CTA with boundary-setting copy -->\n        <section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-8 pb-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"final cta section\" id=\"advisor\">\n            <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] bg-[var(--navy)] px-14 py-14 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"final cta container\">\n                <div class=\"absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full border border-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"decorative circle 1\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute -right-6 -top-6 h-36 w-36 rounded-full border border-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative circle 2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cta-grid relative grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"final cta grid\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"final cta text group\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#9DDFE3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"final cta label\">\n                            Ready for a closer look?\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[640px] text-[36px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"final cta title\">\n                            Turn your subjects into a shortlist you can discuss with confidence.\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[650px] text-[15px] leading-7 text-[#D4DCE8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"final cta description\">\n                            Check your eligibility against the requirements recorded in USPA, then confirm your final choice with the university.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"final cta button group\">\n                        <a class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[8px] bg-[var(--teal)] px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-bold text-white no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"check eligibility button\" href=\"#eligibility\">\n                            Check eligibility\n                            <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-2-1-1\" data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" data-name=\"arrow icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#fff\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-white/25 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-bold text-white no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"browse programmes button\" href=\"#programmes\">\n                            Browse programmes\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[var(--navy-deep)] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-grid mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] gap-12 px-8 py-14\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer content container\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand column\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name group\">\n                    <span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-[9px] bg-[var(--teal)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" data-name=\"graduation cap icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#fff\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <strong class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                        USPA\n                    </strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[270px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#AAB8CC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                    Smart Programme Advisor — helping prospective students discover academic programmes.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[11px] text-[#7F91AA]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer provider credit\">\n                    Platform by Bamenda Tech Research Center (BTRC).\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer explore column\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#9DDFE3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer explore title\">\n                    Explore\n                </h3>\n                <ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-3 text-[13px] text-[#C1CCDB]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer explore links\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"footer explore link item\">\n                        <a class=\"no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"explore link 1 text\" href=\"#programmes\">\n                            Browse programmes\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"footer explore link item\">\n                        <a class=\"no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"explore link 2 text\" href=\"#faculties\">\n                            Faculties & schools\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"footer explore link item\">\n                        <a class=\"no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"explore link 3 text\" href=\"#eligibility\">\n                            Check eligibility\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"footer about column\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#9DDFE3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer about title\">\n                    About the guide\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#AAB8CC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer about text\">\n                    USPA helps you understand listed programme information. It does not replace an official admission decision.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-4\" data-name=\"footer context column\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#9DDFE3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"footer context title\">\n                    University context\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#AAB8CC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2\" data-name=\"university context text\">\n                    <i class=\"mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-2-1\" data-lucide=\"building-2\" data-name=\"building icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#9DDFE3\">\n                    </i>\n                    The University of Bamenda\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#AAB8CC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-3\" data-name=\"email context text\">\n                    <i class=\"mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-3-1\" data-lucide=\"mail\" data-name=\"mail icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#9DDFE3\">\n                    </i>\n                    btrcbambili@gmail.com\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"border-t border-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom row\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-8 py-5 text-center text-[11px] text-[#7F91AA]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                © 2026 USPA. Platform by Bamenda Tech Research Center (BTRC). All rights reserved.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
